    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a coping mechanism, isn't it? \"creating meaning\" is just a way to distract ourselves from the fact that objectively, there is none. we're just chemical reactions trying to convince ourselves we matter so we don't fall apart. if you look at it purely through a logical lens, without the human need to feel special, everything looks pretty hollow. it feels less like an \"opportunity\" and more like a cruel joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
